# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Environment-specific values live OUTSIDE this repository, in the settings
# folder $ASRE_HOME (asre.env, *.tfvars, bootstrap state; see the README's Deploy section). The patterns
# below are a second line of defence in case a copy lands here by mistake.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Terraform / OpenTofu
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# Environment files
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
.envrc

# Credentials — none should ever exist: CI uses Workload Identity Federation,
# services use their own identities, secret values live in Secret Manager.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*-key.json
*credentials*.json
application_default_credentials.json
service-account*.json
.gcloud/
kubeconfig*
